  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>ВНИМАНИЕ: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/legendary-survival-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Legendary Survival Overhaul</a> и&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> являются <span style=\"color:#f00\">ОБЯЗАТЕЛЬНЫМИ</span>!</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>Введение</strong></h4><p>Этот мод просто добавляет блок фильтра для песка из <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thirst-was-taken\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thirst Was Taken</a> в <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/legendary-survival-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Legendary Survival Overhaul</a>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>Примеры</strong></h4><p><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MRkerei6xn8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p>",
